    "short_description": "ALDI France is the French branch of ALDI Nord, a prominent European discount supermarket chain that began operations in France in 1988. With over 1,300 stores and approximately 14,814 employees, ALDI France focuses on providing high-quality products at low prices. The company emphasizes simplicity, responsibility, and reliability, ensuring efficient processes and customer-centric operations.\n\nSpecializing in discount grocery retailing, ALDI France offers around 2,000 products, with 80% being own-brand items. The product range includes essentials like groceries, with a commitment to sustainability reflected in healthier options, plant-based proteins, and organic products. ALDI France aims to reduce food waste and optimize resource efficiency while serving millions of customers daily.",
